# Cloudflare Pages / Netlify redirects.
#
# /abf-ticketing was live for a few hours on 8 September 2026 as a seventh case
# study before the ticketing work was folded into the festival case as a
# chapter. Without this rule the path falls through to index.html and answers
# 200, which is a soft 404: a crawler that saw the page reads the homepage as
# its new content rather than learning the page moved.
#
# 301 rather than 302, because it is not coming back.
/abf-ticketing   /africa-blockchain-festival   301
/abf-ticketing/  /africa-blockchain-festival   301
